[agent] Statistics jobs run server-side on the full FG (cumulative as-of each commit). Per-day commits would give cumulative means from which exact per-day means are recoverable by arithmetic. Let me test feasibility and timing with a few incremental commits on a fresh FG.
[agent:bash] cd "$(pwd)" && ./venv/bin/python -c "
[agent:bash] import pandas as pd, hopsworks, time
